WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.260
So I got to practice with these guys, and I played football with them during the year.

2
00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:10.600
I played basketball with them during the year.

3
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:13.480
I ran track with them during the year.

4
00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:16.780
So I figure, well, it's summertime we're playing baseball.

5
00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:19.680
We should be okay.

6
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:25.700
Well they all stayed in huddles a lot in practice.

7
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:27.540
So I practiced.

8
00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:31.460
They played; I practiced.

9
00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:34.580
So it got time for the first game.

10
00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:39.980
Now this is an all-white team, and I'm the only black on this team.

11
00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:43.680
So I'm the only black kid, so I'm sitting in the bench.

12
00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:48.620
I go sit by this guy named Bur, see.

13
00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:52.580
He is the second-string quarterback for the high school.

14
00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:55.340
I know him.

15
00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:57.440
I'm on the same football team with him.

16
00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:00.520
So I go sit by him in the dugout.

17
00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:08.280
His daddy comes to talk to him at the fence, and he moves to the other end of the dugout.

18
00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:11.540
Now, I'm the only one, sitting right here.

19
00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:14.600
Everybody else sitting over there.

20
00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:16.820
I'm like, "What's going on?"

21
00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:20.640
I ask Burt, said, "What's going on?' He said, "My step-daddy said,

22
00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:27.900
'Boy if you want to sleep in my house tonight don't be sitting by that nigger.'" So he moved.

23
00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:31.040
I said, "Man, look! [laughing] You got to go home tonight, man.

24
00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:31.620
You got to.

25
00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:33.780
I understand.

26
00:01:33.780 --> 00:01:36.560
You got to live in that man . . . Go over there.

27
00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:38.780
I'm fine over here by myself."

28
00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:39.940
He said, "Man I'm sorry.

29
00:01:39.940 --> 00:01:41.240
I ain't got no choice."

30
00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:43.320
I said, "I do understand that."

31
00:01:43.320 --> 00:01:44.320
I understand that.
